OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F317A1783673336
OL,3,CFerrari's Charles Leclerc wins British
OL,4,CGrand Prix
OL,6,FGeorge Russell's bid to win a maiden
OL,7,Fworld championship was dealt a
OL,8,Fsignificant boost after Kimi Antonelli
OL,9,Ffailed to score in a dramatic
OL,10,Fconclusion to Sunday's British Grand
OL,11,FPrix, which was won by Charles Leclerc.
OL,13,FLeclerc ended a 624-day winless streak
OL,14,Fto take the win at Silverstone, but
OL,15,Fthe drama unfolded behind the
OL,16,FMonegasque as Antonelli surrendered
OL,17,Fsecond place when a suspension failure
OL,18,Fstruck his Mercedes with just 11 laps
OL,19,Fto go.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/4
