PN,31704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F317A1783673336
OL,3,CFerrari's Charles Leclerc wins British
OL,4,CGrand Prix
OL,6,FAntonelli's demise has allowed Russell
OL,7,Fto reduce his rival's championship
OL,8,Fadvantage from 43 points to 25.
OL,10,FHamilton, who will be hugely aggrieved
OL,11,Fto have given up second place
OL,12,Ffollowing a pit-stop behind the safety
OL,13,Fcar, is 32 points back in the title
OL,14,Frace. He also faces a stewards'
OL,15,Finvestigation for a yellow-flag
OL,16,Finfringement.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/4
